    {
      "text": "You can add custom controls to use as part of your AppProtection profiles in the Zscaler Admin Console. To learn more, see About AppProtection Profiles. For a complete list of ranges and limits for custom controls, see Ranges & Limitations."
    },
    {
      "text": "To add a new custom control:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Private Access > Private App Protection > Protection Controls > Custom Controls.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          20
        ],
        [
          23,
          45
        ],
        [
          48,
          67
        ],
        [
          70,
          85
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Add.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Add Custom Control window appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          22
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Add Custom Control window, complete the following steps:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          25
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select Control Type",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Name: Enter a name for the custom control. The name cannot contain special characters, with the exception of periods (.), hyphens (-), and underscores ( _ ).",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Control Type: Select an option:",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Request: A message from the client to the server for the request.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          7
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Response: A response from the server to the client for the request.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          8
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Choose one or more control parameters for the selected control type. Click Select All to choose all parameters, or click Clear All to remove all selections.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          75,
          85
        ],
        [
          121,
          130
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Request Control Type",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Request Header",
      "depth": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          14
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Request Uri",
      "depth": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Query String",
      "depth": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Request Cookie",
      "depth": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          14
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Request Body",
      "depth": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          12
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Request Method",
      "depth": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          14
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Response Control Type",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          21
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Response Header",
      "depth": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          15
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Response Body",
      "depth": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Description: (Optional) Enter a description.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Next.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Set Control Definition",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "On the Set Control Definition tab, enter settings for the control parameters you selected on the previous tab. This defines how the Private Access (ZPA) service inspects user traffic.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          29
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Enter the relevant information for the control parameter. For example, if the control parameter is a Request Header, enter the header name.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "There is a limit of 2,500 characters for the text field.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "For Size, select an operator and enter a value. Click Add More if you need additional sizes for the control parameter. There is a 1 MB inspection limit for Request and Response Headers, so only the first 1 MB will be inspected.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          8
        ],
        [
          54,
          62
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "If =, >, or < are used once when setting up a custom control, you can't use it again in the same custom control.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "For Value, select an operator and, if required, enter a value:",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Regex: A regular expression control parameter that matches the value specified.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          5
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Does not match Regex: A regular expression control parameter that does not match the value specified.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Contains: A control parameter that contains the value specified.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          8
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Does not contain: A control parameter that does not contain the value specified.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          16
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Starts with: A control parameter that starts with the value specified.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Does not start with: A control parameter that does not start with the value specified.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Ends with: A control parameter that ends with the value specified.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          9
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Does not end with: A control parameter that does not end with the value specified.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          17
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Exists: A control parameter to check if a control type is present. This parameter is available only for Request Header, Request Cookie, Query String, and Response Header.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          6
        ],
        [
          104,
          118
        ],
        [
          120,
          134
        ],
        [
          136,
          148
        ],
        [
          154,
          169
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Does not exist: A control parameter to check if a control type is absent. This parameter is available only for Request Header, Request Cookie, Query String, and Response Header.",
      "depth": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          14
        ],
        [
          111,
          125
        ],
        [
          127,
          141
        ],
        [
          143,
          155
        ],
        [
          161,
          176
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Add More if you need additional values for the control parameter. To learn more, see Defining Regular Expression Values.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          14
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "For Request Method, select from one of the available options:",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
