          0,
          3
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In addition to severity levels, custom controls have a paranoia level of 1 as they are used in an AppProtection profile.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Action section for Transaction, select how the user traffic is handled for the control parameters:",
